[PrintTextModified Text:――さっさと行け！<br>理性がまだ残っているうちに！|#0104Adv02_Alisa018| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:そんな、アリサちゃ――。|#0104Adv02_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

